---

## 4. Find Maximum

```java
int largest = Integer.MIN_VALUE;

if (arr[i] > largest) {
    largest = arr[i];
}
```

---

## 5. Find Minimum

```java
int smallest = Integer.MAX_VALUE;

if (arr[i] < smallest) {
    smallest = arr[i];
}
```

---

