```java
arr[i] % 2 == 0
```

---

## 7. Odd Number

```java
arr[i] % 2 != 0
```

---

## 8. Compare Adjacent Elements

```java
arr[i] > arr[i + 1]
```

Useful for:

* Sorted array
* Increasing/decreasing checks
* Adjacent comparisons

